      "content": "When developing these profiles, focus on behaviors rather than assumptions about people to keep your SOPs objective. For example, you might flag groups with visibly boisterous energy or clusters congregating in non-designated public areas. Another type to monitor could be those exhibiting signs of intoxication or disruptive interaction with staff. This approach allows staff to intervene proactively based on observable behavior to preserve your upscale atmosphere.",
